\paragraph{Results:}
The results of the survey are given in Table~\ref{tab:reviewer-opinions}. We pay each reviewer \$15 to participate in this survey. 
Specifically, we find positive evidence that the reviewers think our system's reviews were better on average than the \singlellm\ reviews across the ``Reproducibility and Quality'' metric in the \textsc{Aaai 2024} dataset. The reviewers' scores for our system's reviews were significantly higher (p-value = 0.02) than for \singlellm\ reviews across this metric: $0.427 \pm 0.007$. 
